  "notes": "From English 'paint.' Used both for the substance (paint) and, with ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧, for the act of painting or coating something. Common in DIY, automotive, and design contexts.\n\nUSAGE:\n- ペイント⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to paint, to coat\n- ⟦{壁|かべ}→壁：01290_kabe⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ペイント⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to paint a wall\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦ペンキ→ペンキ：00342_penki⟧: paint — the everyday word for house paint (from Dutch)\n- ⟦{塗料|とりょう}→塗料：24548_toryou⟧: paint, coating material — a more technical term",
